de/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 内容\n\n本 PR 汇总当前 S5 / S5M2 固件与应用层研究，并新增 LUMIX Lab APK 静态分析。\n\n### 文件\n\n- `docs/S5与S5M2固件研究交接报告.md`\n  - DC-S5 HTTP 控制协议\n  - UPD 容器与分区结构\n  - 解密尝试及 S5M2 跨机型证据\n- `docs/LUMIX_LAB_S5M2_APK_ANALYSIS.md`\n  - LUMIX Lab 3.1.0 / versionCode 22 静态分析范围\n  - DC-S5M2 型号识别\n  - 相机通过 BLE 回传的功能位元遮罩\n  - Live Delivery bit 3 应用端入口\n  - 固件清单、授权、相机端能力与验证边界\n\n## 重要结论\n\n- 已确认 Live Delivery 菜单由功能遮罩 bit 3 控制，可作为最小 APK 端验证点。\n- 这只代表可进入 App 服务流程，不代表已取得相机内核、Shell、任意代码执行或韧体签章绕过。\n- APK、反编译全文、工具和大型日志未上传。\n- S5 实机结果与 S5M2 静态分析证据保持明确区分。\n\n## 后续建议\n\n先记录 S5M2 实际回传的功能遮罩和能力字串，再判断限制位于 App 或相机韧体。","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-09T17:45:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T06:05:20Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"28de79973b85ec909b26985ced823335ec2566e8","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"kings1221-code:contrib/s5-s5m2-research-handoff","ref":"contrib/s5-s5m2-research-handoff","repo":{"id":1412151948,"node_id":"R_kgDOVCu6jA","name":"lumix-s1m2-research","full_name":"kings1221-code/lumix-s1m2-research","owner":{"login":"kings1221-code","id":327107699,"node_id":"U_kgDOE39Ecw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327107699?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kings1221-code","html_url":"https://github.com/kings1221-code","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kings1221-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kings1221-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kings1221-code/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kings1221-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kings1221-code/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kings1221-code/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kings1221-code/repos","events_url